Package: machash
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: hash strings into MAC addresses
 machash hashes input strings with the 48-bit Bobcat hash and
 prints the result as a colon-separated MAC address. The address
 is fake, but it has the form of a valid MAC address. This is
 useful for deriving a stable, deterministic MAC address from any
 string.
